{"sessions": "1", "seconds": 240.0, "legs": {"call04_agent": {"name": "call04_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_5ejjdxg04hlonw2v", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.4, "item_id": "item_lfema5rbso19f3uo", "transcript": "您好，这里是 Orbix 客服热线，请问有什么可以帮您？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 248.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.7, "commit_t": 12.2, "item_id": "item_xkh4lebkmfxyjo6s", "transcript": "请问您的手机号码是多少？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 218.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 21.8, "commit_t": 24.3, "item_id": "item_jjl9go623v0ii758", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 209.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 37.84, "commit_t": 41.8, "item_id": "item_tydq94cisd6frp2w", "transcript": "补卡本身收取少量工本费，邮寄是免费的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 265.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 45.62, "commit_t": 49.8, "item_id": "item_7cabg1785qvatvxj", "transcript": "好的，请您告诉我收货地址和联系电话。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 240.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 53.46, "commit_t": 60.5, "item_id": "item_bih674ebspttpics", "transcript": "新卡的初始 PIN 码在卡片的背面，您收到以后可以在手机设置里修改。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 325.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 64.14, "commit_t": 72.3, "item_id": "item_fxk5tvnaljv61ur5", "transcript": "可以去任何一家营业厅，带上身份证就行。也可以在 App 里申请邮寄，三天内送到。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 318.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 75.12, "commit_t": 81.0, "item_id": "item_ye4jzxjlbcgeuhyg", "transcript": "已经停机了，请问您需要补办新的 SIM 卡，还是直接开通 eSIM？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 308.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 83.82, "commit_t": 90.6, "item_id": "item_7hknlsr5i155k881", "transcript": "您别着急，为了安全，我先帮您临时停机，这样别人就不能使用您的号码了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 330.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 101.6, "commit_t": 104.7, "item_id": "item_9qwkyhysldgsx4ft", "transcript": "好的，有任何问题随时联系我们。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 216.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 110.92, "commit_t": 118.7, "item_id": "item_wkohpmn4e6e90607", "transcript": "这种户型建议使用 Mesh 路由器组网，在卧室再放一个节点，信号就能覆盖全屋。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 355.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 121.36, "commit_t": 122.5, "item_id": "item_gjbvmk73pczl4xeh", "transcript": "不复杂。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 181.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 122.6, "commit_t": 127.2, "item_id": "item_rvtna6grmjgop29m", "transcript": "插上电，用 App 扫码，大约五分钟就可以完成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 282.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 127.38, "commit_t": 131.1, "item_id": "item_lss3kkhjhc9tha7q", "transcript": "如果您需要，我们也可以安排工程师上门安装。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 241.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 134.5, "commit_t": 141.9, "item_id": "item_2zpqin39m8ndx2ah", "transcript": "我们有三支装和四支装的套装，具体价格您可以在 App 的商城里面查看，现在有活动。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 360.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 144.08, "commit_t": 150.2, "item_id": "item_krzqnoq8xp2kb83h", "transcript": "购买套装包含一次免费上门安装，单独预约的话需要收取少量的服务费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 287.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 155.08, "commit_t": 161.3, "item_id": "item_kfp2jptnn6afud57", "transcript": "最好使用同一品牌的设备，这样可以统一管理，切换房间的时候也不会断网。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 275.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 172.64, "commit_t": 179.7, "item_id": "item_z8rvzloefz2n51zj", "transcript": "系统显示是三个月前通过 App 开通的，当时有一个免费体验，到期以后自动续费了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 328.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 184.18, "commit_t": 186.3, "item_id": "item_s116z1k3i1df0cul", "transcript": "好的，我帮您查一下。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 179.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 186.36, "commit_t": 188.2, "item_id": "item_drmtydv7jxvkgq68", "transcript": "请问是哪一天扣的？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 221.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 191.2, "commit_t": 194.7, "item_id": "item_85w8tp8g7ysustij", "transcript": "不客气，请问还有什么可以帮您的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 241.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 196.4, "commit_t": 203.5, "item_id": "item_017igxpgnduoxm5w", "transcript": "因为您没有使用过这个会员，我可以帮您申请退还这一个月的费用，同时关闭自动续费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 342.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 205.98, "commit_t": 212.0, "item_id": "item_5ifh5pdpzuj3ntbd", "transcript": "已经关闭了，退款会在五个工作日内原路退回到您的话费账户。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 286.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 212.58, "commit_t": 215.4, "item_id": "item_j0q9msflt752zr8e", "transcript": "请问还有其他需要帮助的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 213.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 219.84, "commit_t": 223.1, "item_id": "item_kbiax02od6xi5n7f", "transcript": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快，再见。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 244.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call07_agent": {"name": "call07_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_e3vswaexp7gm3ryo", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.42, "commit_t": 6.3, "item_id": "item_dygalvpunoogqb87", "transcript": "您好，Zentra，我是客服专员，请问您需要办理什么业务？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 287.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.96, "commit_t": 12.9, "item_id": "item_gn28ogyu0q9balo7", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 237.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 17.16, "commit_t": 21.4, "item_id": "item_enjpvhvx4oy8ig10", "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 249.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 21.44, "commit_t": 23.9, "item_id": "item_01umbhvgff2uwp2b", "transcript": "请问，您的姓氏是？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 206.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 38.84, "commit_t": 44.6, "item_id": "item_0n9gd0f6f9g4fpzo", "transcript": "可以的，您可以在 App 里选择号码转 eSIM，不需要去营业厅。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 303.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 51.24, "commit_t": 60.0, "item_id": "item_vvk6cweb9pd8ztum", "transcript": "在 App 的 EICM 界面点击生成二维码，有效期是半小时，过期需要重新生成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 338.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 68.3, "commit_t": 70.7, "item_id": "item_0yn1w6las3mtkc1h", "transcript": "这个型号是支持的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 190.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 70.96, "commit_t": 77.6, "item_id": "item_p7f2u5bxa72losgo", "transcript": "我先帮您把二维码重新发送到您的邮箱，您可以直接在手机上打开。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 301.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 78.4, "commit_t": 80.4, "item_id": "item_uuvs79jbv08ipta7", "transcript": "嗯嗯。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 183.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 85.02, "commit_t": 86.8, "item_id": "item_p0r38pqjkbohc9f8", "transcript": "好的，不着急。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 187.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 86.84, "commit_t": 93.1, "item_id": "item_fkvu417mkjzme6yb", "transcript": "如果升级以后还是不行，您把手机型号告诉我，我帮您核对是否支持。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 312.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 97.34, "commit_t": 105.5, "item_id": "item_5by09zfl1gl58fjb", "transcript": "您需要准备身份证，并保证手机连着 WiFi，因为开通过程中会下载一个二维码配置。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 318.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 111.72, "commit_t": 116.0, "item_id": "item_58ms2hz3ywlrcv6u", "transcript": "请您检查一下手机系统是不是最新版本。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 229.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 116.38, "commit_t": 121.1, "item_id": "item_inkgbz68h1hbcfnh", "transcript": "有的机型需要先做一次 OTA 升级才能识别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 262.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 126.52, "commit_t": 128.1, "item_id": "item_fgrrng9b4u9s0whb", "transcript": "太好了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 184.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 128.1, "commit_t": 131.6, "item_id": "item_j7uuq3yyoq4l1kno", "transcript": "激活以后，实体卡会自动停用。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 243.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 131.6, "commit_t": 134.9, "item_id": "item_kttz554ju2naba2o", "transcript": "请您确认手机信号是不是正常。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 229.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 149.54, "commit_t": 154.9, "item_id": "item_yalaqsi69vd2jh7n", "transcript": "您原来的合约不受影响，新套餐从下个月一号开始生效。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 278.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 154.9, "commit_t": 157.6, "item_id": "item_ou276xh2ninejyh0", "transcript": "当月仍按原套餐计费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 227.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 161.68, "commit_t": 164.0, "item_id": "item_7xcbhcoy3fvtd0wn", "transcript": "收到了，办理成功。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 215.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 164.02, "commit_t": 168.8, "item_id": "item_jnen4160wim9kwvw", "transcript": "新套餐下个月一号生效，您可以在 App 里查看详情。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 256.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 169.72, "commit_t": 172.5, "item_id": "item_9mznfcp2t1f7spxk", "transcript": "我给您介绍一下这几个套餐的区别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 219.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 173.2, "commit_t": 177.6, "item_id": "item_gpp2nwte8bh3h61j", "transcript": "五 G 畅享 199，包含充足的国内流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 281.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 177.8, "commit_t": 182.7, "item_id": "item_5yjv2bl5xloagowq", "transcript": "通话时长足够日常使用，并且赠送一个视频会员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 239.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 183.36, "commit_t": 187.9, "item_id": "item_h314vpc9kw197mhq", "transcript": "5G 尊享 299，则包含更多的流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 272.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 187.9, "commit_t": 192.8, "item_id": "item_5g94rc2l217x9ne1", "transcript": "还可以和家人共享，最多可以添加三位家庭成员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 244.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 193.38, "commit_t": 199.8, "item_id": "item_z0dtsgym80d92m9x", "transcript": "这些套餐都支持 e3m，您可以不用换卡，在手机里直接开通。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 290.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 200.48, "commit_t": 207.8, "item_id": "item_avf2dsuep5mwasfe", "transcript": "超出套餐流量以后，网速不会断，但是会降低。您也可以随时购买加油包。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 304.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 208.34, "commit_t": 211.0, "item_id": "item_vn3684bg2v54qyzy", "transcript": "套餐的变更需要您本人办理。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 216.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 211.04, "commit_t": 214.2, "item_id": "item_w3u7h8mfuqq4m1nz", "transcript": "办理成功后，会收到短信通知。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 202.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 31, "speech_t": 216.46, "commit_t": 221.6, "item_id": "item_gh0rz9ogp4di5h9o", "transcript": "套餐名字里的数字就是月费，包含充足的通话和流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 271.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 32, "speech_t": 224.06, "commit_t": 228.8, "item_id": "item_sj0qibyb6z6i85nb", "transcript": "网速是一样的，区别主要在流量和附加权益。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 250.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 33, "speech_t": 229.08, "commit_t": 233.4, "item_id": "item_6kgnqzzzso360z4t", "transcript": "尊享套餐可以免费使用 Orbix 的云盘空间。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 256.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}}, "bot_rows": null}